Number of partitions of n into 7 distinct positive Fibonacci numbers (with a single type of 1).

The 88 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `53`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A358007

